- Pflanzenbilder besitzen Rohstoff-, Press-, Lager- und Auszugslose;
- Biological zeigt Becken-, Gefäß-, Wasch-, Übergabe- und Wartungsstationen;
- Astro ist ein gewöhnlicher Himmels-/Kalenderalmanach.

- fünf Herbal-Records verwalten Pflanzenrohstoffe, Auszüge, Duft-, Wasch-,
  Farb-, Bindungs- oder Zurichtungsmaterial;
- sechs Biological-Records verwalten Becken, Charge, Temperierung, Lauf,
  Filterung, Ablass, Nachfüllung und Übergabe;
- drei Astrodiagramme bilden einen selbständigen Arbeits-/Wahlalmanach.

- heterogeneous useful knowledge can be one working book rather than one
  unified treatise;
- register changes can reflect source blocks and production circumstances;
- copying exemplars and adding local practical material are historically
  ordinary behaviors.

The ten pages now make one executable workshop book: select a pictured simple;
select the women's bath/application configuration; veto treatment of the body
region governed by the Moon's zodiac sign; recognize the one-of-28 station;
consult the corresponding f69 rule; then perform or withhold the procedure.

1. a practitioner first reduces ordinary multilingual or vernacular technical
   prose to an elliptical record, omitting what the picture, page register and
   routine already supply;

2. recurrent content words, relation words, quantities and technical states are
   copied as learned or locally invented abbreviations, some of them radically
   homographic;

- Herbal: `f10r`, `f11r`, `f55v`, `f56r`;
- Biological: `f81v`, `f82r`, `f83r`;
- circle/astronomical: `f67r2`, `f68r1`, `f69v`.

